---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import WhatsAppCTA from '../components/WhatsAppCTA.astro';
---

<Base
  title="How Buying Works — Art De Areka"
  description="Buying original art, made simple: ask about a piece on WhatsApp, see it on your wall or in the gallery, and we deliver and hang it for you. No pressure at any step."
>
  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:44px">
    <p class="kicker">How Buying Works</p>
    <h1 class="display">Simpler than you think</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin:14px 0 0">
      Most people who buy from us have never bought original art before. Here's the
      whole process — no jargon, no pressure, and you can stop at any step.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:36px">
    <ol class="step-list">
      <li>
        <div>
          <h4>Ask about a piece — or about your wall</h4>
          <p>WhatsApp us about any artwork in the collection, or start with a free
          <a href="/preview" class="textlink">Wall Preview</a> and let the right piece find you.
          Every listed work shows its size and price range up front.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div>
          <h4>See it properly</h4>
          <p>Visit the gallery to stand in front of it — entry is free — or let us
          mock it up on a photo of your own wall first. For most pieces we can hold
          it briefly while you decide.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div>
          <h4>Confirm the price</h4>
          <p>We publish honest price ranges and confirm the exact price when you ask.
          No games — the price is the price, and it includes our advice on framing
          and placement.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div>
          <h4>Delivered and hung</h4>
          <p>We coordinate delivery and hang the work properly — right height, right
          fixings, level. Your job is to stand back and look.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:40px">
    <div class="qa hairline-block">
      <p class="kicker" style="margin-bottom:10px">Common questions</p>
      <dl>
        <dt>Do I need to know about art?</dt>
        <dd>No. Tell us about your room and what you like — that's all the expertise required.</dd>
        <dt>Are the works originals?</dt>
        <dd>Yes — every piece in the collection is an original work, not a print or reproduction.</dd>
        <dt>Payment and delivery details?</dt>
        <dd>Ask us on WhatsApp and we'll confirm the current options for your purchase and area.</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" style="margin-top:50px">
    <div class="wrap band-grid">
      <div>
        <h2 class="title-lg">Step one costs nothing</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin:8px 0 0">Send a message. That's the whole first step.</p>
      </div>
      <WhatsAppCTA
        label="Start on WhatsApp"
        prefill="Hi Art De Areka, I'd like to ask about buying a piece."
      />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .qa { padding: 26px 0; }
  dl { margin: 0; max-width: 62ch; }
  dt { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 14px; }
  dd { font-size: 13px; color: var(--dim); margin: 4px 0 0; }
</style>
